1960       options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
1960     ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
1961       %let syscc=0;
1962       title; footnote;
1963       ods _all_ close;
1964       ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
1965       ods graphics off;
1966       proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
